  ProPDFs sitemap. Hand-maintained for now (32 tools + 5 marketing
  pages); a generator script can take over once the catalog grows
  past ~50 entries.

  Last-updated <lastmod> is in ISO 8601. Crawlers re-fetch on
  change-freq hints — `weekly` is generous for a tool catalog
  whose URL set rarely changes.

  Per-tool entries are KEY for ranking on the
  "[tool name] online free" queries that drive most of our search
  traffic. Each tool page renders the unique page we built — not
  a generic merge fallback — so we can confidently list every
  one in the sitemap.
-->
